# FiveM resources are read by a Linux server as often as a Windows one, and a
# repo that stores CRLF produces a diff full of phantom line changes the first
# time someone edits it on the other platform. Normalise on commit, check out
# LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.lua  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary
*.ytd binary
*.ydr binary
